# Veetee Groq test harness input (one API key per line).
#
# This file is a template only. Put real keys in secrets/groq.keys; that file is
# ignored and must never be committed, logged, pasted into chat, or copied into
# runtime config. The harness may try the next key after a test-only 429, but
# production provider selection always uses one configured secretRef.
#
# GROQ_TEST_KEY_1=replace-me
# GROQ_TEST_KEY_2=replace-me
